# Prettier's own default is only .gitignore-unaware node_modules, so without
# this `npx prettier --check .` — which is exactly what CI runs — walks every
# other checkout of this repo living under a worktree directory, plus their
# dependencies and build output. It reported 3,595 files needing formatting,
# none of them this repo's.
#
# Both spellings on purpose: `.worktrees/` is the manual convention and
# `.claude/worktrees/` is where the agent tooling puts them. eslint.config.mjs
# and vitest.config.ts each carry the same pair, for the same reason.
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/

# Build output and generated files.
.next/
out/
build/
coverage/
node_modules/
playwright-report/
test-results/
src/generated/
data/

# Not ours to format.
package-lock.json
